{
  "title": "Repetition, Repetition, Repetition (The Secret To Mastering Success)",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg-1",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3520,
      "text": "Repetition is the secret to mastering success."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-2",
      "startMs": 3520,
      "endMs": 6880,
      "text": "By constantly taking action and being consistent,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-3",
      "startMs": 6880,
      "endMs": 9680,
      "text": "you will get the results that you've always wanted."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-4",
      "startMs": 9680,
      "endMs": 13920,
      "text": "This is what I call the law of exponential momentum."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-5",
      "startMs": 14800,
      "endMs": 16600,
      "text": "Basically what I mean by this is,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-6",
      "startMs": 16600,
      "endMs": 19720,
      "text": "by putting in effort every single day"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-7",
      "startMs": 19720,
      "endMs": 23280,
      "text": "towards a goal or a plan,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-8",
      "startMs": 23280,
      "endMs": 27400,
      "text": "eventually the results will start to 10x themselves."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-9",
      "startMs": 27400,
      "endMs": 30040,
      "text": "Now, what you did didn't change,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-10",
      "startMs": 30040,
      "endMs": 33200,
      "text": "but the amount of time you've put in"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-11",
      "startMs": 33200,
      "endMs": 37440,
      "text": "and the amount of effort you've put in have, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-12",
      "startMs": 37440,
      "endMs": 39560,
      "text": "You can work on something for three to six months"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-13",
      "startMs": 39560,
      "endMs": 41160,
      "text": "and see absolutely no results,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-14",
      "startMs": 41160,
      "endMs": 42380,
      "text": "and we've seen this happen before."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-15",
      "startMs": 42380,
      "endMs": 43480,
      "text": "If you take a look at anybody,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-16",
      "startMs": 43480,
      "endMs": 46960,
      "text": "it seems like somebody can do something for so long"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-17",
      "startMs": 46960,
      "endMs": 48400,
      "text": "without getting any results from it,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-18",
      "startMs": 48400,
      "endMs": 51400,
      "text": "but then almost overnight, boom."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-19",
      "startMs": 51400,
      "endMs": 55500,
      "text": "It all changes, and all of the results come at once."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-20",
      "startMs": 55500,
      "endMs": 58100,
      "text": "That is what the law of exponential momentum is,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-21",
      "startMs": 58100,
      "endMs": 59820,
      "text": "and that is what it means."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-22",
      "startMs": 59820,
      "endMs": 62740,
      "text": "So by being consistent and by putting in daily effort"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-23",
      "startMs": 62740,
      "endMs": 65220,
      "text": "and taking action towards something that you want"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-24",
      "startMs": 65220,
      "endMs": 67180,
      "text": "without seeing the results,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-25",
      "startMs": 67180,
      "endMs": 71500,
      "text": "eventually the results will be far greater"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-26",
      "startMs": 71500,
      "endMs": 73860,
      "text": "than what you originally thought they were gonna be."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-27",
      "startMs": 73860,
      "endMs": 76140,
      "text": "And it's going to be hard, I'm not gonna lie to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-28",
      "startMs": 76140,
      "endMs": 79020,
      "text": "You're going to have to delay your gratification."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-29",
      "startMs": 79020,
      "endMs": 80980,
      "text": "You're not gonna see results for a long time."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-30",
      "startMs": 80980,
      "endMs": 85220,
      "text": "Maybe you'll get 0.01% results every single day"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-31",
      "startMs": 85940,
      "endMs": 86780,
      "text": "for a certain amount of time,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-32",
      "startMs": 86780,
      "endMs": 88380,
      "text": "two months, three months, six months,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-33",
      "startMs": 88380,
      "endMs": 92980,
      "text": "and then out of nowhere, your results will 10x themselves."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-34",
      "startMs": 93940,
      "endMs": 96100,
      "text": "There's two different ways that you could apply this."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-35",
      "startMs": 96100,
      "endMs": 100400,
      "text": "Now number one is the repetition of identity changing,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-36",
      "startMs": 100400,
      "endMs": 103820,
      "text": "and this is through picking habits, ideas, and thoughts"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-37",
      "startMs": 103820,
      "endMs": 106220,
      "text": "that align with the person that you want to be."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-38",
      "startMs": 106220,
      "endMs": 108240,
      "text": "The repetition of your thoughts"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-39",
      "startMs": 108240,
      "endMs": 111500,
      "text": "will translate into your physical reality."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-40",
      "startMs": 111500,
      "endMs": 114620,
      "text": "Now repetition isn't just through"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-41",
      "startMs": 114620,
      "endMs": 117460,
      "text": "what you do physically here, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-42",
      "startMs": 117460,
      "endMs": 119280,
      "text": "I can work out every single day."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-43",
      "startMs": 119280,
      "endMs": 120860,
      "text": "I put in the reps, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-44",
      "startMs": 120860,
      "endMs": 122420,
      "text": "I can read every single day."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-45",
      "startMs": 122420,
      "endMs": 123820,
      "text": "I put in the reps."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-46",
      "startMs": 123820,
      "endMs": 126940,
      "text": "But repetition of your thought will dictate"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-47",
      "startMs": 126940,
      "endMs": 129540,
      "text": "and lead where your life is going."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-48",
      "startMs": 129540,
      "endMs": 131700,
      "text": "So you need to start thinking in alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-49",
      "startMs": 131700,
      "endMs": 134100,
      "text": "with the person that you want to be"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-50",
      "startMs": 134100,
      "endMs": 137420,
      "text": "because the only way to break"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-51",
      "startMs": 137420,
      "endMs": 140760,
      "text": "your subconscious level of thought"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-52",
      "startMs": 140760,
      "endMs": 144760,
      "text": "is to actively think thoughts"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-53",
      "startMs": 144760,
      "endMs": 148040,
      "text": "that no longer align with the person that you once were."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-54",
      "startMs": 148040,
      "endMs": 150080,
      "text": "You need to start thinking in a way"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-55",
      "startMs": 150080,
      "endMs": 153080,
      "text": "and acting in a way that is aligned"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-56",
      "startMs": 153080,
      "endMs": 155160,
      "text": "with the person that you want to be,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-57",
      "startMs": 155160,
      "endMs": 157880,
      "text": "and then you will see your physical reality around you"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-58",
      "startMs": 157880,
      "endMs": 159980,
      "text": "will start to change because of it."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-59",
      "startMs": 161000,
      "endMs": 164720,
      "text": "Now the second thing is repetition of habit,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-60",
      "startMs": 164720,
      "endMs": 167280,
      "text": "the things that you do physically."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-61",
      "startMs": 167280,
      "endMs": 169680,
      "text": "You should be making a schedule"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-62",
      "startMs": 169720,
      "endMs": 172800,
      "text": "down to the very minute with your day."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-63",
      "startMs": 173880,
      "endMs": 176000,
      "text": "If you know what you're doing every single second"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-64",
      "startMs": 176000,
      "endMs": 179040,
      "text": "and you know exactly why you're doing what you're doing,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-65",
      "startMs": 179040,
      "endMs": 182600,
      "text": "it makes it very easy to get results from them."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-66",
      "startMs": 182600,
      "endMs": 183560,
      "text": "Let's say this."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-67",
      "startMs": 183560,
      "endMs": 187160,
      "text": "Me personally, I get up at 7.30 every single day, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-68",
      "startMs": 187160,
      "endMs": 188920,
      "text": "I know exactly what I'm doing."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-69",
      "startMs": 188920,
      "endMs": 192480,
      "text": "I'm getting up, I stretch, I put my clothes on,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-70",
      "startMs": 192480,
      "endMs": 195720,
      "text": "I go outside, I take a run, I come back,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-71",
      "startMs": 195720,
      "endMs": 199560,
      "text": "I do a cold shower, I sit down, I do some work,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-72",
      "startMs": 200400,
      "endMs": 203120,
      "text": "I eat it this time, I come back, I do more work."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-73",
      "startMs": 204040,
      "endMs": 207040,
      "text": "That is the repetition of my habits."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-74",
      "startMs": 207040,
      "endMs": 209760,
      "text": "I don't even have to question what I'm doing next"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-75",
      "startMs": 209760,
      "endMs": 212760,
      "text": "because I know exactly what I'm doing"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-76",
      "startMs": 212760,
      "endMs": 214420,
      "text": "every single moment of the day."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-77",
      "startMs": 215280,
      "endMs": 217460,
      "text": "You should be doing the exact same."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-78",
      "startMs": 218560,
      "endMs": 219400,
      "text": "Now,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-79",
      "startMs": 222040,
      "endMs": 225880,
      "text": "it's going, it doesn't seem like a lot,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-80",
      "startMs": 225880,
      "endMs": 229300,
      "text": "but by being consistent with your actions,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-81",
      "startMs": 230040,
      "endMs": 231860,
      "text": "by being consistent with what you do every single day"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-82",
      "startMs": 231860,
      "endMs": 233660,
      "text": "and having a schedule,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-83",
      "startMs": 233660,
      "endMs": 237900,
      "text": "it makes it very easy to get more results because of it."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-84",
      "startMs": 237900,
      "endMs": 240640,
      "text": "Miraculously, out of nowhere, like I said,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-85",
      "startMs": 240640,
      "endMs": 243140,
      "text": "you're going to start seeing more results."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-86",
      "startMs": 243140,
      "endMs": 245860,
      "text": "And once you are consistent with your habits,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-87",
      "startMs": 245860,
      "endMs": 248660,
      "text": "you can then start to push the limits"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-88",
      "startMs": 248660,
      "endMs": 250580,
      "text": "of what you are able to accomplish"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-89",
      "startMs": 250580,
      "endMs": 252700,
      "text": "in the time that you've given yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-90",
      "startMs": 252700,
      "endMs": 256780,
      "text": "Now, that is what is called the Parkinson's Law."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-91",
      "startMs": 256780,
      "endMs": 260940,
      "text": "And that law states that you only finish the things"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-92",
      "startMs": 260940,
      "endMs": 263900,
      "text": "that you, you only finish things in the allotted time"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-93",
      "startMs": 263900,
      "endMs": 265980,
      "text": "that you give yourself to finish them."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-94",
      "startMs": 265980,
      "endMs": 269340,
      "text": "If I give myself a month to work on a video,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-95",
      "startMs": 269340,
      "endMs": 272140,
      "text": "it's going to take me an entire month to work on a video."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-96",
      "startMs": 272140,
      "endMs": 274820,
      "text": "But then again, if I give myself five minutes"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-97",
      "startMs": 274820,
      "endMs": 276460,
      "text": "to sit down and make a video,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-98",
      "startMs": 276460,
      "endMs": 278500,
      "text": "I will finish it in five minutes."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-99",
      "startMs": 279380,
      "endMs": 283860,
      "text": "The Parkinson's Law states that you finish"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-100",
      "startMs": 283860,
      "endMs": 285640,
      "text": "whatever it is that you give yourself,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-101",
      "startMs": 285640,
      "endMs": 288140,
      "text": "whatever task that you have at hand"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-102",
      "startMs": 288140,
      "endMs": 290780,
      "text": "in the time that you are given for it."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-103",
      "startMs": 290780,
      "endMs": 293680,
      "text": "So what you need to do is start trying"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-104",
      "startMs": 293680,
      "endMs": 296500,
      "text": "to achieve more in less time."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-105",
      "startMs": 296500,
      "endMs": 298320,
      "text": "And I guarantee you,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-106",
      "startMs": 298320,
      "endMs": 300720,
      "text": "you will start to achieve more in less time,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-107",
      "startMs": 300720,
      "endMs": 304360,
      "text": "which will give you more room to get more results."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-108",
      "startMs": 306140,
      "endMs": 308940,
      "text": "This is the law of exponential momentum."
    }
  ],
  "languageDetected": "english"
}